1 2 [c] An HCP is a registered user of the iTrust2 system (UC1). The HCP has authenticated in the system (UC2). An Emergency Responder is a registered user of the iTrust2 system (UC1). The Emergency Responder has authenticated in the system (UC2).
2 3 [s] user The approved user enters the desired patients First and/or Last Name (or a correct substring of either/both) into the search box. The patients with first/last names containing the substring(s) provided are shown.
3 4 [e] system displays a success message and logs transaction
4 5 [c] System processes request successfully and logs transaction.
